<body>
  <noscript style="color:red; text-align:center;">
    <h1>To use this website, JavaScript needs to be enabled.</h1>
    <p>You can come back when you turn it on though :)</p>
  </noscript>
  <div class="borders"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <header class="clearfix">
      <h1>Devicon <span><a href="https://github.com/devicons/devicon/releases" class="ng-binding">v2.17.0</a></span></h1>
      <h2>Devicon is a set of icons representing programming languages, designing, and development tools. You can use it as a font or directly copy/paste the SVG code into your project.</h2>
      <i>*Please read the legal conditions of using the logos here at the bottom of this header</i>
      <h3>(Super) Quick Setup</h3>
      <h5>First select an icon on the right, then select the version below and copy/paste the code into your project.</h5>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <h4>
            Font versions 
            <span>
              <img src="./9_files/color_wheel.png" class="colorPicker" ng-click="toggleColorPickerMenu(&#39;fontColorPickerMenu&#39;)">
              <span class="colorPickerMenu" id="fontColorPickerMenu">
                <div>
                  <input type="color" value="#60be86" ng-model="fontBackground" class="ng-pristine ng-valid">
                  Background Color 
                </div>
                <div>
                  <input type="checkbox" id="checkboardInputFont" class="checkerboardInput ng-pristine ng-valid" ng-model="fontDisplayCheckerboard">
                  <label for="checkboardInputFont">Checkerboard</label>
                </div>
                <button class="colorPickerBtn" ng-click="toggleColorPickerMenu(&#39;fontColorPickerMenu&#39;)">Close</button>
                <button class="colorPickerBtn" ng-click="fontBackground = DEFAULT_BACKGROUND; fontDisplayCheckerboard=0; toggleColorPickerMenu(&#39;fontColorPickerMenu&#39;)">Reset</button>
              </span>
            </span>
          </h4>
          <p>
            Place this in your header (once per HTML file) 
            <span>
              <img src="./9_files/copy.svg" class="copyBtn" ng-click="copyToClipboard($event, &#39;headerLinkCode&#39;)">
              <span class="tooltip"></span>
            </span>
          </p>
          <div class="cde ng-binding" id="headerLinkCode">
            &lt;link rel="stylesheet" type='text/css' href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/devicon.min.css" /&gt;
          </div>

          <ul class="icons-list">
            <!-- ngRepeat: fontVersion in selectedIcon.font --><div ng-repeat="fontVersion in selectedIcon.font" class="ng-scope">
              <li ng-click="selectFont(fontVersion, false, $index)" ng-class="{&#39;selected-version&#39; : ($index == selectedFontIndex &amp;&amp; !colored)}" ng-style="{&#39;background-color&#39;: fontBackground}" class="selected-version" style="background-color: rgb(61, 149, 97);">
                <img src="./9_files/checkerboard.png" ng-style="{&#39;visibility&#39;: fontDisplayCheckerboard ? &#39;visible&#39; : &#39;hidden&#39;}" style="visibility: hidden;">
                <i class="devicon-azure-plain"></i>
              </li>
              <li ng-click="selectFont(fontVersion, true, $index)" ng-class="{&#39;selected-version&#39; : ($index == selectedFontIndex &amp;&amp; colored)}" ng-style="{&#39;background-color&#39;: fontBackground}" style="background-color: rgb(61, 149, 97);">
                <img src="./9_files/checkerboard.png" ng-style="{&#39;visibility&#39;: fontDisplayCheckerboard ? &#39;visible&#39; : &#39;hidden&#39;}" style="visibility: hidden;">
                <i class="devicon-azure-plain colored"></i>
              </li>
            </div><!-- end ngRepeat: fontVersion in selectedIcon.font --><div ng-repeat="fontVersion in selectedIcon.font" class="ng-scope">
              <li ng-click="selectFont(fontVersion, false, $index)" ng-class="{&#39;selected-version&#39; : ($index == selectedFontIndex &amp;&amp; !colored)}" ng-style="{&#39;background-color&#39;: fontBackground}" style="background-color: rgb(61, 149, 97);">
                <img src="./9_files/checkerboard.png" ng-style="{&#39;visibility&#39;: fontDisplayCheckerboard ? &#39;visible&#39; : &#39;hidden&#39;}" style="visibility: hidden;">
                <i class="devicon-azure-plain-wordmark"></i>
              </li>
              <li ng-click="selectFont(fontVersion, true, $index)" ng-class="{&#39;selected-version&#39; : ($index == selectedFontIndex &amp;&amp; colored)}" ng-style="{&#39;background-color&#39;: fontBackground}" style="background-color: rgb(61, 149, 97);">
                <img src="./9_files/checkerboard.png" ng-style="{&#39;visibility&#39;: fontDisplayCheckerboard ? &#39;visible&#39; : &#39;hidden&#39;}" style="visibility: hidden;">
                <i class="devicon-azure-plain-wordmark colored"></i>
              </li>
            </div><!-- end ngRepeat: fontVersion in selectedIcon.font -->
          </ul>
          <p>
            Place this in your body 
            <span>
              <img src="./9_files/copy.svg" class="copyBtn" ng-click="copyToClipboard($event, &#39;iconClassCode&#39;)">
              <span class="tooltip"></span>
            </span>
          </p>
          <div class="cde ng-binding" id="iconClassCode">
            &lt;i class="devicon-azure-plain<!-- ngIf: colored -->"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;<br>
          </div>
          <p><i>*To change the size, change the &lt;i&gt;'s <code>`font-size`</code>.</i></p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h4>
            SVG versions 
            <span>
              <img src="./9_files/color_wheel.png" class="colorPicker" ng-click="toggleColorPickerMenu(&#39;svgColorPickerMenu&#39;)">
              <span class="colorPickerMenu" id="svgColorPickerMenu">
                <div>
                  <input type="color" value="#60be86" ng-model="svgBackground" class="ng-pristine ng-valid">
                  Background Color 
                </div>
                <div>
                  <input type="checkbox" id="checkboardInputSvg" class="checkerboardInput ng-pristine ng-valid" ng-model="svgDisplayCheckerboard">
                  <label for="checkboardInputSvg">Checkerboard</label>
                </div>
                <button class="colorPickerBtn" ng-click="toggleColorPickerMenu(&#39;svgColorPickerMenu&#39;)">Close</button>
                <button class="colorPickerBtn" ng-click="svgBackground = DEFAULT_BACKGROUND; svgDisplayCheckerboard=0; toggleColorPickerMenu(&#39;svgColorPickerMenu&#39;)">Reset</button>
              </span>
            </span>
          </h4>
          <ul class="icons-list">
            <!-- ngRepeat: svgVersion in selectedIcon.svg --><li ng-repeat="svgVersion in selectedIcon.svg" ng-click="selectSvg(svgVersion, $index)" ng-class="{&#39;selected-version&#39; : $index == selectedSvgIndex}" ng-style="{&#39;background-color&#39;: svgBackground}" class="ng-scope selected-version" style="background-color: rgb(61, 149, 97);">
              <img src="./9_files/checkerboard.png" ng-style="{&#39;visibility&#39;: svgDisplayCheckerboard ? &#39;visible&#39; : &#39;hidden&#39;}" style="visibility: hidden;">
              <img class="svgLogo" ng-src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/azure/azure-original.svg" src="./9_files/azure-original.svg">
            </li><!-- end ngRepeat: svgVersion in selectedIcon.svg --><li ng-repeat="svgVersion in selectedIcon.svg" ng-click="selectSvg(svgVersion, $index)" ng-class="{&#39;selected-version&#39; : $index == selectedSvgIndex}" ng-style="{&#39;background-color&#39;: svgBackground}" class="ng-scope" style="background-color: rgb(61, 149, 97);">
              <img src="./9_files/checkerboard.png" ng-style="{&#39;visibility&#39;: svgDisplayCheckerboard ? &#39;visible&#39; : &#39;hidden&#39;}" style="visibility: hidden;">
              <img class="svgLogo" ng-src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/azure/azure-original-wordmark.svg" src="./9_files/azure-original-wordmark.svg">
            </li><!-- end ngRepeat: svgVersion in selectedIcon.svg --><li ng-repeat="svgVersion in selectedIcon.svg" ng-click="selectSvg(svgVersion, $index)" ng-class="{&#39;selected-version&#39; : $index == selectedSvgIndex}" ng-style="{&#39;background-color&#39;: svgBackground}" class="ng-scope" style="background-color: rgb(61, 149, 97);">
              <img src="./9_files/checkerboard.png" ng-style="{&#39;visibility&#39;: svgDisplayCheckerboard ? &#39;visible&#39; : &#39;hidden&#39;}" style="visibility: hidden;">
              <img class="svgLogo" ng-src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/azure/azure-plain.svg" src="./9_files/azure-plain.svg">
            </li><!-- end ngRepeat: svgVersion in selectedIcon.svg --><li ng-repeat="svgVersion in selectedIcon.svg" ng-click="selectSvg(svgVersion, $index)" ng-class="{&#39;selected-version&#39; : $index == selectedSvgIndex}" ng-style="{&#39;background-color&#39;: svgBackground}" class="ng-scope" style="background-color: rgb(61, 149, 97);">
              <img src="./9_files/checkerboard.png" ng-style="{&#39;visibility&#39;: svgDisplayCheckerboard ? &#39;visible&#39; : &#39;hidden&#39;}" style="visibility: hidden;">
              <img class="svgLogo" ng-src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/azure/azure-plain-wordmark.svg" src="./9_files/azure-plain-wordmark.svg">
            </li><!-- end ngRepeat: svgVersion in selectedIcon.svg -->
          </ul>
          <p>
            Using &lt;img&gt; element 
            <span>
              <img src="./9_files/copy.svg" class="copyBtn" ng-click="copyToClipboard($event, &#39;imgCode&#39;)">
              <span class="tooltip"></span>
            </span>
          </p>
          <div class="cde ng-binding" id="imgCode">
            &lt;img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/azure/azure-original.svg" /&gt;<br>
          </div>
          <p><i>*To change the size, change the &lt;img&gt;'s <code>`height`</code> and <code>`width`</code>.</i></p>

          <br>

          <p>
            Using Pure SVG 
            <span>
              <img src="./9_files/copy.svg" class="copyBtn" ng-click="copyToClipboard($event, &#39;svgCode&#39;)">
              <span class="tooltip"></span>
            </span>
          </p>
          <div class="cde" id="svgCode">
            &lt;svg viewBox="0 0 128 128"&gt;<br>
            <div class="cde-ind ng-binding">&lt;defs&gt;&lt;linearGradient id="azure-original-a" x1="60.919" y1="9.602" x2="18.667" y2="134.423" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"&gt;&lt;stop stop-color="#114A8B"&gt;&lt;/stop&gt;&lt;stop offset="1" stop-color="#0669BC"&gt;&lt;/stop&gt;&lt;/linearGradient&gt;&lt;linearGradient id="azure-original-b" x1="74.117" y1="67.772" x2="64.344" y2="71.076" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"&gt;&lt;stop stop-opacity=".3"&gt;&lt;/stop&gt;&lt;stop offset=".071" stop-opacity=".2"&gt;&lt;/stop&gt;&lt;stop offset=".321" stop-opacity=".1"&gt;&lt;/stop&gt;&lt;stop offset=".623" stop-opacity=".05"&gt;&lt;/stop&gt;&lt;stop offset="1" stop-opacity="0"&gt;&lt;/stop&gt;&lt;/linearGradient&gt;&lt;linearGradient id="azure-original-c" x1="68.742" y1="5.961" x2="115.122" y2="129.525" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"&gt;&lt;stop stop-color="#3CCBF4"&gt;&lt;/stop&gt;&lt;stop offset="1" stop-color="#2892DF"&gt;&lt;/stop&gt;&lt;/linearGradient&gt;&lt;/defs&gt;&lt;path d="M46.09.002h40.685L44.541 125.137a6.485 6.485 0 01-6.146 4.413H6.733a6.482 6.482 0 01-5.262-2.699 6.474 6.474 0 01-.876-5.848L39.944 4.414A6.488 6.488 0 0146.09 0z" fill="url(#azure-original-a)" transform="translate(.587 4.468) scale(.91904)"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;path d="M97.28 81.607H37.987a2.743 2.743 0 00-1.874 4.751l38.1 35.562a5.991 5.991 0 004.087 1.61h33.574z" fill="#0078d4"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;path d="M46.09.002A6.434 6.434 0 0039.93 4.5L.644 120.897a6.469 6.469 0 006.106 8.653h32.48a6.942 6.942 0 005.328-4.531l7.834-23.089 27.985 26.101a6.618 6.618 0 004.165 1.519h36.396l-15.963-45.616-46.533.011L86.922.002z" fill="url(#azure-original-b)" transform="translate(.587 4.468) scale(.91904)"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;path d="M98.055 4.408A6.476 6.476 0 0091.917.002H46.575a6.478 6.478 0 016.137 4.406l39.35 116.594a6.476 6.476 0 01-6.137 8.55h45.344a6.48 6.48 0 006.136-8.55z" fill="url(#azure-original-c)" transform="translate(.587 4.468) scale(.91904)"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;</div>
            &lt;/svg&gt;
          </div>
          <p><i>*To change the size, change the &lt;svg&gt;'s <code>`height`</code> and <code>`width`</code>.</i></p>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>GitHub repository</h3>
      <h5>If you prefer a local install, you can download all the files on the GitHub repository.</h5>
      <h5>Check out our <a href="https://github.com/devicons/devicon#building-devicon">ultimate guide</a> in order to compile Devicon locally.</h5>
      <p class="buttonLink">
        <a href="https://github.com/devicons/devicon/archive/master.zip"><i class="devicon-github-original"></i>DOWNLOAD</a>
      </p>
      <p class="buttonLink">
        <a href="https://github.com/devicons/devicon/" target="blank"><i class="devicon-github-original"></i>GO TO THE REPOSITORY</a>
      </p>
      <p class="buttonLink">
        <a href="https://github.com/devicons/devicon/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md" target="blank"><i class="devicon-github-original"></i>CONTRIBUTE</a>
      </p>
      <p class="buttonLink">
        <a href="https://discord.gg/hScy8KWACQ" target="blank"><i class="discord-logo"></i>DISCORD COMMUNITY</a>
      </p>

      <h3>Contact</h3>
      <h5>If you have any legal concerns regarding copyrights or want to report an abuse, please reach out to us via <b><a href="mailto:info@devicon.dev">info@devicon.dev</a> or our <a href="https://discord.gg/hScy8KWACQ" target="blank">Discord community</a></b>. Any code/logo contributions should be made through our GitHub repository listed above.</h5>

      <footer>
        Originally created by <a href="https://github.com/konpa">Konpa</a> (under the <a href="https://github.com/devicons/devicon/blob/master/LICENSE">MIT License</a>) and <br>
        supported by many <a href="https://github.com/devicons/devicon/graphs/contributors">contributors</a>.<br>
